        "id": "tool:read-purchase-card",
        "listed_on": "2026-10-05T16:00:00Z",
        "label": "Read the card a purchase uses",
        "job": "Read the brand, last four digits and expiry of the card one verified funding purchase is paid with; operator only.",
        "description": "Runs only on this service's operator account, through its Stripe connection: reads one subscription with its card expanded and answers only the card's brand, last four digits, expiry and wallet, so a payer's Billing screen can show which card pays each purchase. Never reads or returns the card number.",
